                  "id": "PhqnV",
                  "name": "why",
                  "fill": "$ink-muted",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The CLI's accept has no host guard — a bare-metal run succeeds and the corruption only surfaces when CI's guard trips on the next check. Two ways in, both container-run: dispatch accept-baselines on the branch (nothing to install), or run the pinned container locally. The console never accepts — its promote writes the instance's own data directory, and the committed corpus changes by a commit a person reviews.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
